{"id":"rolle","lemma":"Rolle","pos":"noun","rank":669,"glosses":["roll, reel, spool","roll, tube","a relatively small wheel on which something is rolled (as on a wheelie bin)"],"ipa":"/ˈʁɔlə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/cc/De-at-Rolle.ogg/De-at-Rolle.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Rolle","plural":"Rollen"},"examples":[{"text":"Was ich tue, spielt keine Rolle.","en":"It doesn't matter what I do.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/593244","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to do","l":"tun"},{"g":"to play","l":"spielen"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null]},{"text":"Es wird keine Rolle spielen.","en":"It won't matter.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/667077","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null,{"g":"to play"}]},{"text":"Spielt es eine Rolle, was wir tun?","en":"Does it matter what we do?","words":[{"g":"to play","l":"spielen"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"what"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"to do"}]},{"text":"Du hast auch eine Rolle zu spielen.","en":"You also have a role to play.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"also"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to play"}]},{"text":"Sie haben die Rolle bekommen.","en":"You got the part.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"have"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to receive"}]}]}